{
  "//": [
    "Composite indexes, version-controlled alongside firestore.rules.",
    "",
    "Firestore auto-indexes every field on its own. A COMPOSITE index is needed",
    "the moment a query filters on one field and orders by another — which is",
    "most of the pending-work queues in this app. Without one the query does not",
    "return empty, it THROWS failed-precondition, so the badge or the list is not",
    "just wrong, the page is broken.",
    "",
    "The Console prints a create-this-index link in the error. Clicking it works,",
    "but it creates the index only in whichever project you were signed in to,",
    "leaves nothing in the repo, and has to be repeated per environment by",
    "whoever happens to hit the error first. This file is the same thing, in git,",
    "deployed with: npx firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes",
    "",
    "'in' filters count as equality for index purposes, so a branch-scoped",
    "manager query needs the same shape as the unscoped admin one plus the",
    "branch field in front.",
    "",
    "Indexes are additive and non-destructive: deploying builds them in the",
    "background and breaks nothing while they build. This is NOT true of",
    "firestore.rules — see docs/rules-rollout.md."
  ],
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "Navbar invite badge — fires for every signed-in user, so this is the first index anyone hits.",
      "collectionGroup": "participantInvites",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "inviteeUid",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Loyalty approvals queue — admin (unscoped).",
      "collectionGroup": "transactions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Loyalty approvals queue — manager, scoped to their branches.",
      "collectionGroup": "transactions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "branchId",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "createdAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "Customer profile — their own transaction history.",
      "collectionGroup": "transactions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
